---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - Costa Ledger">
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 py-16 flex-grow w-full">
    
    <!-- HEADER -->
    <div class="mb-10 border-b border-[#E5E4DF] pb-6">
      <span class="bg-[#07182D] text-[#F9F9F6] text-[9px] font-bold tracking-widest uppercase px-2.5 py-1 mb-4 inline-block">
        GOVERNANCE & PRIVACY
      </span>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#121212] mb-3">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <div class="text-xs text-[#666666] space-y-1 font-sans">
        <p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> January 1, 2026</p>
        <p><strong>Data Controller:</strong> MGO Asset Holdings LLC (d/b/a Costa Ledger), Fort Lauderdale, Florida, USA.</p>
        <p><strong>Contact:</strong> <a href="mailto:privacy@costaledger.com" class="text-[#C5A059] underline">privacy@costaledger.com</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- DOCUMENT CONTENT -->
    <div class="prose max-w-none text-sm text-[#2A2E33] leading-relaxed space-y-6">
      
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-[#121212] mb-2">1. Overview & Data Controller</h2>
        <p>
          MGO Asset Holdings LLC ("Costa Ledger," "we," "us," or "our"), headquartered in Fort Lauderdale, Florida, USA, operates as the Data Controller responsible for your personal information. This Privacy Policy governs data collected across our web platform, The Ledger Briefing subscription, intelligence downloads, and partner introduction requests. We adhere strictly to the General Data Protection Regulation (EU GDPR & UK GDPR), the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA/CPRA), and the Lei Geral de Proteção de Dados (Brazil LGPD).
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="pt-4 border-t border-[#E5E4DF]">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-[#121212] mb-2">2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Identity & Contact Data:</strong> Name, business/personal email address, phone number, and country of residence.</li>
          <li><strong>Investment & Relocation Intent:</strong> Geographic areas of interest (e.g., Costa del Sol, Gibraltar, Portugal), capital allocation ranges, service needs (real estate, legal/tax advisory, residency visas, mortgage financing), and purchase timelines.</li>
          <li><strong>Technical & Analytics Data:</strong> IP address, device type, operating system, and interaction metrics gathered via privacy-first server analytics and essential session state.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="pt-4 border-t border-[#E5E4DF]">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-[#121212] mb-2">3. Lawful Basis & How We Use Your Data</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Editorial & Intelligence Delivery:</strong> Processing subscriptions and dispatching requested market reports, intelligence alerts, and newsletters (Basis: Consent / Performance of Contract).</li>
          <li><strong>Partner Introductions & Client Pre-Registration:</strong> When you request private assistance or click to access partner services, we share your contact and criteria profile with our vetted execution partners (e.g., law firms, mortgage brokers, estate agencies). This includes performing necessary client pre-registrations to protect attribution and commission rights under formal collaboration agreements.</li>
          <li><strong>Platform Optimization & Marketing:</strong> Serving relevant market commentary and creating anonymous audience profiles on platforms like Meta Ads (Basis: Legitimate Interest & Consent).</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="pt-4 border-t border-[#E5E4DF]">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-[#121212] mb-2">4. International Data Transfers & Data Protection</h2>
        <p>
          Your data is securely stored in encrypted cloud environments (including US and EU data centers). Because MGO Asset Holdings LLC operates globally from the United States, cross-border data transfers comply with standard contractual clauses (SCCs) and international privacy frameworks. Costa Ledger never sells, rents, or trades your personal data to open advertising networks or third-party lead brokers.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="pt-4 border-t border-[#E5E4DF]">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-[#121212] mb-2">5. Data Retention & Your Legal Rights</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          We retain personal records only for as long as necessary to fulfill editorial and commercial introduction workflows or legal compliance obligations. You hold the following rights:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 mb-3">
          <li>Right to access, inspect, or rectify your data.</li>
          <li>Right to request complete erasure ("Right to be Forgotten").</li>
          <li>Right to withdraw consent or unsubscribe at any time via the one-click link in our communications.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          To exercise any data rights, submit your request to <a href="mailto:privacy@costaledger.com" class="text-[#C5A059] underline">privacy@costaledger.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>